":32}]},{"text":"구조를 시용해야 할 것이다. 따라서 스택이 자연스럽게 후보 자료 구조가 된다. 구체적으로 현재","words":[{"text":"구조를","x":189,"y":1874,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"시용해야","x":284,"y":1873,"width":115,"height":31},{"text":"할","x":408,"y":1874,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"것이다.","x":448,"y":1874,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"따라서","x":552,"y":1874,"width":81,"height":31},{"text":"스택이","x":646,"y":1876,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"자연스럽게","x":742,"y":1875,"width":139,"height":31},{"text":"후보","x":893,"y":1875,"width":58,"height":31},{"text":"자료","x":961,"y":1875,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"구조가","x":1029,"y":1876,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"된다.","x":1127,"y":1876,"width":63,"height":32},{"text":"구체적으로","x":1204,"y":1877,"width":145,"height":32},{"text":"현재","x":1361,"y":1878,"width":54,"height":31}]},{"text":"위치에서 갈 수 있는 방들의 좌표를 스택에 기억하였다가 막다른 길을 만나면 아직 가보지 않은","words":[{"text":"위치에서","x":190,"y":1926,"width":109,"height":32},{"text":"갈","x":314,"y":1927,"width":29,"height":30},{"text":"수","x":353,"y":1926,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"있는","x":394,"y":1927,"width":56,"height":30},{"text":"방들의","x":460,"y":1927,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"좌표를","x":556,"y":1928,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"스택에","x":652,"y":1928,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"기억하였다가","x":749,"y":1928,"width":170,"height":32},{"text":"막다른","x":929,"y":1929,"width":86,"height":31},{"text":"길을","x":1027,"y":1929,"width":57,"height":30},{"text":"만나면","x":1095,"y":1930,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"아직","x":1193,"y":1930,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"가보지","x":1262,"y":1930,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"않은","x":1360,"y":1931,"width":58,"height":30}]},{"text":"방 중에서 가장 가까운 방으로 다시 돌아가서 새로운 경로를 찾아보는 것이다. 또한 한번 지나간","words":[{"text":"방","x":190,"y":1980,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"중에서","x":228,"y":1980,"width":82,"height":31},{"text":"가장","x":324,"y":1980,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"가까운","x":392,"y":1980,"width":85,"height":31},{"text":"방으로","x":486,"y":1981,"width":85,"height":30},{"tex